{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819880/extras/41c841209f7bb1d11ccd8ae744c867a2.avif?t=1751310846\" data-has-big width=800 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hunt In Sanity (T.H.I.S)</strong> is a psychological atmospheric horror game that plunges players into a haunting descent through trauma, grief, and madness. Drawing inspiration from old classic horror games<i>.</i>\u00a0T.H.I.S combines chilling exploration, cryptic storytelling, and visceral fear to deliver a deeply immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819880/extras/d814758960d3cf818974a00025bd21fb.poster.avif?t=1751310846\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819880/extras/d814758960d3cf818974a00025bd21fb.webm?t=1751310846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819880/extras/d814758960d3cf818974a00025bd21fb.mp4?t=1751310846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Introduction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a crash returning home your wife vanishes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step out desperate to find her. You discovered that she's tied to a god\u2019s awakening ritual and now you must not only save her, but also stop the ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path is perilous and dangerous!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>The Hunt In Sanity</strong>, Time is running out!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819880?t=1751310846","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819880/79e8c9109a673a1f2f801677968901da2018aa78/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751310846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819880/a662c73af3d055e665cc8440638a451a53ea6c8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751310846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819880/a662c73af3d055e665cc8440638a451a53ea6c8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751310846","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Turn Notifications","id":32},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3821250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819880/extras/41c841209f7bb1d11ccd8ae744c867a2.avif?t=1751310846\" data-has-big width=800 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hunt In Sanity (T.H.I.S)</strong> is a psychological atmospheric horror game that plunges players into a haunting descent through trauma, grief, and madness. Drawing inspiration from old classic horror games<i>.</i>\u00a0T.H.I.S combines chilling exploration, cryptic storytelling, and visceral fear to deliver a deeply immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819880/extras/d814758960d3cf818974a00025bd21fb.poster.avif?t=1751310846\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819880/extras/d814758960d3cf818974a00025bd21fb.webm?t=1751310846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819880/extras/d814758960d3cf818974a00025bd21fb.mp4?t=1751310846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Introduction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a crash returning home your wife vanishes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step out desperate to find her. You discovered that she's tied to a god\u2019s awakening ritual and now you must not only save her, but also stop the ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path is perilous and dangerous!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>The Hunt In Sanity</strong>, Time is running out!</p>","developers":["Kaboom Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819880/464ee94500933bb73661c3adc080b546a3c0ea46/header.jpg?t=1751310846","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3819880/815871449/436cf92f7ceb17e2cacaeb33bfa9d4841d6c5269/1750366379/das